BEHAVIOR in-path
DESCRIPTION
  Produces the literal path "input.txt".
CONTRACT
  OUTPUT path bytes 4096
  OUTPUT path_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output
HASH aad3eb8f
IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE path 105 1 0
  STORE path 110 1 1
  STORE path 112 1 2
  STORE path 117 1 3
  STORE path 116 1 4
  STORE path 46 1 5
  STORE path 116 1 6
  STORE path 120 1 7
  STORE path 116 1 8
  STORE path 0 1 9
  STORE path_len 9 8
END
